ing of jungle. He was abandoned in savanna, and has been raised by a chimpanzee, Etekichi. He has a dearest wife, Jane who used to be a top model in New York, but now she looks…Anyway, to protect animals from poachers, Ta-chan is fighting against them with his disciple, Pedro, and a master of Chinese martial arts, Ryo. This anime is based on the manga with the same title; it begins as a comical parody of Tarzan. The first several episodes are comedies, but the rest of the series consists of (rather) serious episodes.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6CrujjLg9J7OfS9TpkOcb2piCl.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7uvWUBpcfCxwdnBxJKHrHhIfJ6t.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1993","release_date":"1993-10-14","runtime_minutes":25,"status":"Ended","country":"اليابان","language":"اليابانية","genres":["رسوم متحركة","حركة ومغامرة","كوميديا"],"genre_keys":["animation","action","comedy"],"similar":["tv15260","tv51817","tv62211","mv774370","tv44593","mv38055","tv2979","tv75086"],"director":null,"cast":[{"name":"岸谷五朗","character":"Tar-chan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pYfDZz5RWLICLvf5p2MN0t8MJOf.jpg"},{"name":"ريو ناتسوكي","character":"Jane","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wxiSwjEDMjgRH41PUiGzLplTBqA.jpg"},{"name":"山口勝平","character":"Etekichi","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mJyxKRZxLv9D7LH5KcNSkjSKYOB.jpg"},{"name":"石井康嗣","character":"Anabebe","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ao882dlS1ERrar6iq0qedBVBAhH.jpg"},{"name":"نوبويوكي هياما","character":"Pedro Kazmaier","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yxAzBPZGSzec9rtulmORY84ijzT.jpg"},{"name":"梁田清之","character":"Ryō-shihan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rczC3GZJDzfMyilcnKPG9OD1F0R.jpg"},{"name":"كوتونو ميتسويشي","character":"Helen Noguchi","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dRqbE5D3uqfKnAPsHp9etsvO1Gg.jpg"}],"trailer_url":null